{"2203320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Meta Ball", "steam_appid": 2203320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are a ball. The world wants you gone.</h2>Meta Ball is a physics-driven arcade platformer built on one deceptively simple idea: keep rolling. Thirty handcrafted levels throw spinning blades, collapsing floors and impossible gaps at you - and every single one is beatable with nothing but a mouse and a keyboard.<br><br>Easy to pick up. Hard to put down. Nearly impossible to master.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203320/extras/a2364370c8a409757b98aa864e5fa086.poster.avif?t=1783945266\" width=618 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203320/extras/a2364370c8a409757b98aa864e5fa086.webm?t=1783945266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203320/extras/a2364370c8a409757b98aa864e5fa086.mp4?t=1783945266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Momentum is everything</h2>Every bounce, every roll, every jump is fully simulated. Read the physics and you'll glide through a level in one clean run. Fight it, and you'll be watching your ball tumble into the void - again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>30 campaign levels</strong> - a difficulty curve that starts friendly and ends merciless<br></li><li><strong>Real physics, real consequences</strong> - momentum, weight and collision you can actually feel<br></li><li><strong>Destructible walls</strong> - some obstacles aren't obstacles. Hit them harder.<br></li><li><strong>Secret rooms</strong> - hidden across the campaign for players who look twice<br></li><li><strong>Bonus levels to unlock</strong> - inc